WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.601
Yevgenia Kara-Murza, the

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:04.204
wife of Vladimir Kara-Murza and Yevgeny,

00:00:04.204 --> 00:00:06.039
I really appreciate your time tonight.

00:00:06.039 --> 00:00:07.674
So your husband was in court today.

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:09.109
I know it was a pretrial hearing

00:00:09.109 --> 00:00:09.976
and then his detention

00:00:09.976 --> 00:00:12.245
period gets extended.

00:00:12.245 --> 00:00:14.581
What can you tell us about where his case

00:00:14.581 --> 00:00:16.683
even stands right now?

00:00:18.551 --> 00:00:19.185
Good evening

00:00:19.185 --> 00:00:20.086
and thank you very much

00:00:20.086 --> 00:00:22.288
for inviting me here tonight.

00:00:22.989 --> 00:00:23.556
My husband's

00:00:23.556 --> 00:00:24.591
pretrial detention

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:26.760
has indeed been extended by the trial.

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:28.428
The actual trial is about to start.

00:00:28.428 --> 00:00:29.863
It's going to be held

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:31.197
within one

00:00:31.197 --> 00:00:31.965
to two weeks,

00:00:31.965 --> 00:00:34.067
according to Vladimir's lawyer in Moscow.

00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:37.203
And so we are waiting for

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:39.172
for it to begin.

00:00:39.272 --> 00:00:41.408
And as you do this, I know you you know,

00:00:41.441 --> 00:00:42.575
you think about your husband is,

00:00:42.575 --> 00:00:42.909
as you know,

00:00:42.909 --> 00:00:43.243
stood up

00:00:43.243 --> 00:00:44.244
for what he thinks is right

00:00:44.244 --> 00:00:46.346
as an opposition leader in Moscow.

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:48.481
Do you think there's any chance

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:50.283
that he could be released

00:00:50.283 --> 00:00:52.052
while Putin is still in power?

00:00:54.788 --> 00:00:56.956
I do not believe that the court

00:00:56.956 --> 00:00:58.224
will somehow decide that

00:00:58.224 --> 00:01:00.460
that my husband is innocent,

00:01:00.493 --> 00:01:02.529
although he, of course, is,

00:01:02.829 --> 00:01:04.764
because there is no justice

00:01:04.764 --> 00:01:06.066
system left in Russia,

00:01:06.066 --> 00:01:07.534
no independent justice system

00:01:07.534 --> 00:01:08.301
left in Russia.

00:01:08.301 --> 00:01:11.604
And courts in Russia are a sham.

00:01:11.638 --> 00:01:13.606
So I am absolutely convinced

00:01:13.606 --> 00:01:15.842
that Vladimir will be sentenced.

00:01:16.376 --> 00:01:18.578
The question is how many years?

00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:21.481
But even that is really irrelevant

00:01:21.481 --> 00:01:23.283
under the circumstances. All right.

00:01:23.283 --> 00:01:23.817
What you're saying is

00:01:23.817 --> 00:01:24.784
you can put a number on it,

00:01:24.784 --> 00:01:25.819
but as long as Putin's there,

00:01:25.819 --> 00:01:28.888
the no, the number means nothing.

00:01:29.189 --> 00:01:32.192
I know that obviously he has,

00:01:32.192 --> 00:01:34.394
as you say, had survived two poisonings.

00:01:34.394 --> 00:01:36.496
He has been through an incredible amount

00:01:36.496 --> 00:01:38.131
as an opposition leader.

00:01:38.131 --> 00:01:39.499
How is he doing right

00:01:39.499 --> 00:01:40.900
now, as far as you understand?

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:42.635
I mean, we see him here in these

00:01:42.635 --> 00:01:44.737
the cages that they allow someone

00:01:44.737 --> 00:01:45.572
who is

00:01:45.605 --> 00:01:46.539
appearing in a trial

00:01:46.539 --> 00:01:47.941
or any kind of a court

00:01:47.941 --> 00:01:49.442
hearing to appear in.

00:01:49.442 --> 00:01:50.009
So that's really

00:01:50.009 --> 00:01:51.311
the only images that we have.

00:01:51.311 --> 00:01:52.378
How is he doing?

00:01:52.378 --> 00:01:53.880
Health wise, as far as you understand?

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:54.180
Now,

00:01:56.249 --> 00:01:57.750
He recently spent several

00:01:57.750 --> 00:01:59.819
days in solitary confinement

00:01:59.886 --> 00:02:01.521
in a disciplinary cell

00:02:01.521 --> 00:02:04.324
for demanding his rights to daily walks

00:02:05.358 --> 00:02:08.261
and while in that solitary confinement,

00:02:08.261 --> 00:02:09.996
he developed

00:02:10.463 --> 00:02:13.433
the same numbness in his extremities

00:02:13.433 --> 00:02:14.534
that he experienced

00:02:14.534 --> 00:02:17.203
after the second poisoning in 2015

00:02:17.871 --> 00:02:20.206
when his peripheral

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:23.176
when he had peripheral nerve damage.

00:02:23.176 --> 00:02:27.247
So basically, the similar symptoms

00:02:27.247 --> 00:02:30.316
are beginning to

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:32.552
he's beginning experiencing

00:02:32.552 --> 00:02:33.786
same symptoms.

00:02:33.786 --> 00:02:37.690
And he did see a neurologist

00:02:38.324 --> 00:02:41.227
because of all the noise that we made

00:02:41.528 --> 00:02:44.297
when we learned about his conditions.

00:02:44.297 --> 00:02:46.499
He's healthy

00:02:46.499 --> 00:02:50.336
and he was diagnosed with polyneuropathy.

00:02:50.837 --> 00:02:52.105
So

00:02:52.805 --> 00:02:55.141
I understand that the conditions

00:02:55.175 --> 00:02:57.043
of his detention,

00:02:57.043 --> 00:02:59.612
including this solitary confinement,

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:02.415
are definitely not good for his health

00:03:02.415 --> 00:03:04.017
after the two poisonings.

00:03:04.017 --> 00:03:06.452
That's experienced in the past.

00:03:06.886 --> 00:03:08.821
And I understand that

00:03:08.821 --> 00:03:10.924
the symptoms are coming back

00:03:12.425 --> 00:03:12.959
in

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:14.761
in a big

00:03:14.761 --> 00:03:15.895
part because he's

00:03:15.895 --> 00:03:17.363
been deprived of movement

00:03:17.363 --> 00:03:19.566
and because of those terrible conditions

00:03:19.566 --> 00:03:21.768
in prison where he's

00:03:22.802 --> 00:03:23.603
he was held

00:03:23.603 --> 00:03:25.471
in solitary confinement

00:03:25.471 --> 00:03:27.674
in very similar conditions

00:03:27.674 --> 00:03:30.310
as Alexei Navalny with his bed, that

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:33.379
it gets affixed to the wall from 6 a.m.

00:03:33.379 --> 00:03:34.380
to 10 p.m..

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:35.815
And there is only one

00:03:35.815 --> 00:03:37.951
small stool in the cell

00:03:37.951 --> 00:03:41.354
and the only piece of furniture

00:03:41.354 --> 00:03:43.122
and no daily walks.

00:03:43.122 --> 00:03:46.759
So that definitely is not good for

00:03:47.293 --> 00:03:48.795
anyone's health.

00:03:48.795 --> 00:03:49.596
Not to mention

00:03:49.596 --> 00:03:51.864
someone went through two point leads

00:03:52.699 --> 00:03:55.034
and before you go, Yevgenia.

00:03:55.034 --> 00:03:56.169
The Biden administration

00:03:56.169 --> 00:03:57.570
has just imposed sanctions

00:03:57.570 --> 00:03:58.504
on a number of Russians

00:03:58.504 --> 00:04:00.073
connected to your husband's detention.

00:04:00.073 --> 00:04:02.308
And obviously they did this

00:04:02.308 --> 00:04:03.109
after quite some time.

00:04:03.109 --> 00:04:04.410
They have finally done it.

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:05.612
Do you believe at this point

00:04:05.612 --> 00:04:06.713
that that will change anything

00:04:09.415 --> 00:04:10.583
Well, first of all, I want

00:04:10.583 --> 00:04:10.950
to say

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:12.719
that I am very grateful

00:04:12.719 --> 00:04:14.320
to everyone who pushed

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:15.288
for these sanctions,

00:04:15.288 --> 00:04:18.625
and I am very grateful to the U.S.

00:04:18.625 --> 00:04:19.158
government

00:04:19.158 --> 00:04:22.061
for actually finally adopting them.

00:04:22.462 --> 00:04:24.931
I believe that in my husband's case,

00:04:24.931 --> 00:04:26.799
someone who has been fighting

00:04:26.799 --> 00:04:28.001
for the introduction

00:04:28.001 --> 00:04:29.402
of the Magnitsky legislation

00:04:29.402 --> 00:04:30.169
around the world

00:04:30.169 --> 00:04:31.638
for over a decade,

00:04:31.638 --> 00:04:32.605
it is only fitting

00:04:32.605 --> 00:04:34.007
that such sanctions

00:04:34.007 --> 00:04:35.041
should be applied

00:04:35.041 --> 00:04:38.511
to those implicated in the unlawful

00:04:38.778 --> 00:04:40.313
prosecution and persecution

00:04:40.313 --> 00:04:42.415
of my husband to date

00:04:42.415 --> 00:04:43.549
as to their effect.

00:04:43.549 --> 00:04:45.018
I don't believe

00:04:45.018 --> 00:04:46.085
that they will change

00:04:46.085 --> 00:04:48.121
the outcome of the trial.

00:04:48.121 --> 00:04:50.156
But I do believe that these sanctions

00:04:50.223 --> 00:04:52.125
send a very clear signal

00:04:52.125 --> 00:04:53.359
to the Russian authorities

00:04:53.359 --> 00:04:54.360
that the situation

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:55.461
with human rights in

00:04:55.461 --> 00:04:57.730
Russia is being watched

00:04:57.730 --> 00:05:00.166
and that the free world

00:05:00.166 --> 00:05:01.067
is concerned

00:05:01.067 --> 00:05:02.635
about human rights violations

00:05:02.635 --> 00:05:04.070
happening in Russia.

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:06.739
And I'm very grateful for that attention.

00:05:07.106 --> 00:05:07.373
All right.

00:05:07.373 --> 00:05:07.840
We'll give you any

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:08.941
I appreciate your time.

00:05:08.941 --> 00:05:10.576
We're grateful to you for joining us.

00:05:10.576 --> 00:05:11.077
Thank you.

